# A door: stand V in front of one, looking at it (teleport there first),
# then run this. It lists what the door offers and opens it as its prompt
# would. The pad's way is "until prompt > 0" then "press x".
limit 60
needs veh == 0
sim door 0 2
act device
act device ToggleOpen
wait 2
optional act device ToggleOpen
